<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN BEROEPSKREDIET 1996 PROFIT SOARS.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN BEROEPSKREDIET 1996 PROFIT SOARS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Belgian francs, unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     264    vs     74</p>
<p>    Interest rate margin		     1,431    vs   1,324</p>
<p>    Gross banking income		     1,672    vs   1,224</p>
<p>    Balance sheet assets		  164,4600    vs  138,568</p>
<p>NOTE - Beroepskrediet/Credit Professionel, a small</p>
<p>state-owned bank, said in a statement on Wednesday that as it</p>
<p>had had the status of private limited company since April 1, it</p>
<p>was now possible for a Belgian or foreign partner to take a</p>
<p>stake in its capital.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
